 on making the Investigation Notebook smoother to use while reviewing clues, organizing notes, and returning to source material. New Features The Investigation Notebook can now be docked to the left side of the screen, then undocked at any time to return to a floating window. Drag the divider to adjust the docked notebook width. Its docked state and width are preserved after restarting the game. Improvements and Fixes Improved split-screen layouts and text readability acr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T04:10:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814448385","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922070-1842212951307685","game_id":"steam-4922070","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Investigation Notebook, Display Settings, and Reading Improvements","summary":"This update introduces the Investigation Notebook and improves display settings, archive research, and evidence reading across the Steam desktop version. New Features Added a global Investigation Notebook for manual notes and citations captured from evidence or archive documents. Search notebook entries and view the investigation timeline by addition order or chronological order. Citation notes can return to their original source and highlight the referenced passage. The notebook window can be m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T14:39:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951307685","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922070-1842212951298674","game_id":"steam-4922070","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Multiple Photos, Branch Dragging, and Improvements","summary":"This Demo update is now live on Windows and macOS. New Features Desktop genealogy nodes can now hold up to two additional photos alongside the primary portrait. Supplemental photos can be replaced or removed, and the layout compacts automatically. Supplemental photos now participate in identity verification. Each correct photo receives its own confirmation feedback and relationship-colored marker; verified photo slots are then locked against accidental changes. Long-press any non-root genealogy ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T02:24:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951298674","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922070-1841579228679579","game_id":"steam-4922070","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Text Size, Finale Links, and Fixes","summary":"This Demo update is now live on Windows and macOS.New features- Added Small (80%), Standard (100%), and Large (120%) body-text options under Settings → Display → Text Size. Changes apply immediately to key reading areas and are saved automatically.- Added finale links to the full game’s Steam page, Bilibili, and Xiaohongshu so you can keep up with future updates.Fixes and improvements- Fixed verified character names that could display incorrectly after upgrading an older Steam save, with stronge","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T20:28:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228679579","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4922070":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:29:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:29:38Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4922070":"2026-10-26T05:29:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4922070":